OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, although a few heavy showers
OL,7,Fare possible, perhaps with the odd
OL,8,Frumble of thunder. Further showers
OL,9,Fspread north around, or just after
OL,10,Fmidnight, perhaps heavy and with
OL,11,Ffrequent lightning in the far east.
OL,12,FChance this remain offshore.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FAny overnight rain easing.
OL,15,Fleaving a largely dry morning with
OL,16,Fsunny spells. Into the afternoon
OL,17,Fscattered showers are expected to
OL,18,Fdevelop, heavy at times, but with some
OL,19,Fparts staying dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
